      "created_at": "2021-03-10T13:49:47.475Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi all,</p>\n<p>I have a player in my campaign with the Impossible Knowledge red ability (from Psychic powers), which allows changing penalties into bonuses.</p>\n<p>It’s not immediately apparent how many penalties can be changed to bonuses each round - if it were limited to one, I’d expect it to say so, but last session he used it to change almost a dozen penalties into corresponding bonuses.</p>\n<p>Does anybody know what the intent of this ability is?</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
